## WHY THIS CONTROL IS NOT VACUOUS
Frame-ness is the ONLY variable between AC-C2 and AC-C3:
  502 on the MAIN FRAME      -> exactly 1 [FAIL] http_status=502
  502 on a SUB-RESOURCE      -> 0 [FAIL]
and for the transport class, the SAME url (10.0.2.2:9099):
  as MAIN FRAME  -> 1 [FAIL] payment_webview_load_failed
  as SUB-RESOURCE-> 0 [FAIL]
So a broken gate (or no gate) would have produced a line here. It did not.
